    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "I reimplemented my config with MiniMax and I in my old config I had the `vim.opt.exrc` option enabled. \r\nAfter switching I realized that the `.nvim.lua` project local config wasn't executed. \r\n\r\nI did some reading and found out that the plugins/ directory gets loaded too late for Neovim to execute the `.nvim.lua` file.\r\n\r\nTo fix this one would need to set this option in `init.lua` and not in the `plugins/` directory. \r\n\r\nSharing this in case others are trying to implement project-specific setting within this config structure. ",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I reimplemented my config with MiniMax and I in my old config I had the <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.opt.exrc</code> option enabled.<br>\nAfter switching I realized that the <code class=\"notranslate\">.nvim.lua</code> project local config wasn't executed.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I did some reading and found out that the plugins/ directory gets loaded too late for Neovim to execute the <code class=\"notranslate\">.nvim.lua</code> file.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To fix this one would need to set this option in <code class=\"notranslate\">init.lua</code> and not in the <code class=\"notranslate\">plugins/</code> directory.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Sharing this in case others are trying to implement project-specific setting within this config structure.</p>",
    "bodyText": "I reimplemented my config with MiniMax and I in my old config I had the vim.opt.exrc option enabled.\nAfter switching I realized that the .nvim.lua project local config wasn't executed.\nI did some reading and found out that the plugins/ directory gets loaded too late for Neovim to execute the .nvim.lua file.\nTo fix this one would need to set this option in init.lua and not in the plugins/ directory.\nSharing this in case others are trying to implement project-specific setting within this config structure.",
