            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for sharing! That is indeed the case. For future reference, `:h startup` has the necessary information about the startup order.\r\n\r\nI would only ask to use `vim.o.exrc = true` (and not `vim.opt.exrc`). This is the recommended approach in light of neovim/neovim#20107.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks for sharing! That is indeed the case. For future reference, <code class=\"notranslate\">:h startup</code> has the necessary information about the startup order.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I would only ask to use <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.o.exrc = true</code> (and not <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.opt.exrc</code>). This is the recommended approach in light of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1364580513\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/20107\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/neovim/neovim/issues/20107/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/20107\">neovim/neovim#20107</a>.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Thanks for sharing! That is indeed the case. For future reference, :h startup has the necessary information about the startup order.\nI would only ask to use vim.o.exrc = true (and not vim.opt.exrc). This is the recommended approach in light of neovim/neovim#20107.",
