            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This looks like important enough note to be added directly to MiniMax. The 'plugin/10_options.lua' seems like a good place, so [it is now there](https://github.com/nvim-mini/MiniMax/blob/70ade6783c9d45d5c81eab5a2d3ff3a62e02066e/configs/nvim-0.11/plugin/10_options.lua#L14-L16).\r\n\r\nThanks again for noticing! I wasn't aware of this nuance.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">This looks like important enough note to be added directly to MiniMax. The 'plugin/10_options.lua' seems like a good place, so <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/MiniMax/blob/70ade6783c9d45d5c81eab5a2d3ff3a62e02066e/configs/nvim-0.11/plugin/10_options.lua#L14-L16\">it is now there</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks again for noticing! I wasn't aware of this nuance.</p>",
